{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a60ea95d7d4b088efe580061107ee57a5e2b772c94100a57d962e87d23e25d93",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7ae441463d049a37403364f1446cfd5dac7cda5599fd4a20f65167f0c379540",
      "text": "笔直奔向所爱！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a1b81aedde3d1d2261971adfb454fb11b8713d0b06a36c1264dda8b6162857",
      "text": "隼人在演唱会上热烈地谈论起自己憧憬的乐队，\n并演奏了其代表曲。\n该视频被上传至新设立的315 Pro官方频道，\n逐渐引发好评。\n不久，也引起了意想不到的人物的注意……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7ae441463d049a37403364f1446cfd5dac7cda5599fd4a20f65167f0c379540",
      "text": "笔直奔向所爱！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f0185213499e6bd63ea311aa99048296db845959029a6352cea0094e7b74ff",
      "text": "High×Joker的演唱会",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb141a39333dd883d20bd06d144b9bdb5deb6b3af58b64af8b70d3b2b86dbb34",
      "text": "演唱会果然是最棒的！\n大家情绪都超级高涨超开心的！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f614e1036a85472c5a64c8546031d10c1a6aa3b14c372a83b7071536d413d4d6",
      "text": "我们明明才刚刚出道，\n竟然有这么多人来看……真的……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cbaba031d998a044f28c11453ffa0c0fd69de6d8e69e49bffd7bc22c710f231",
      "text": "请不要在座这种地方哭出来。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4c10bc9b96ba655e63f89c18bf40f7ec92eae3a8818bd84292358d8f31b0f9f",
      "text": "趁着气氛热烈，进入Talk环节！\n那么夏来，拜托你啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa5ee7621a2286064199ef006401a507cbca5fe3bfad6c44f16bd4705f844018",
      "text": "呀——，夏来君——！\n（今天也好神秘……！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3e46e5c5ad57aaab1daeca8fbb407c295888ca9a3058cf8b93d9d5e78fa4b4",
      "text": "……那个，今天的谈话主题，\n是“憧憬的音乐人”……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3108f9efc78fe320bd8a6ca4b1b6297a9dfa039552f3535d008cf2b563d9e4",
      "text": "憧憬、憧憬……有好多呢，\n很难只选出一个啊～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d72fc7863212687d0c1585345bd8d66e6770a15958f783a2b6050786782c301d",
      "text": "确实……古典还是流行，\n总想按类型分开来考虑呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:944e74635f9f8d46a5c537e83e9ab97d27577b3933ac5ece18aa3a0754068d41",
      "text": "我我！我喜欢“ARROW・B”！\n特别是吉他手史密斯，超级崇拜他！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14a6139359bc4500d7131735aa0f484ca7e2273086c414822a4bb8b2bc5d980d",
      "text": "说起ARROW・B，是那支在我们出生前\n就在开展活动的摇滚乐队吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f75d086034c986ab2347888b48347ac4bad74ebf389d0244d1ee1e381c64d85",
      "text": "现在也依旧宝刀未老活跃在前线呢。\n前阵子因为要举办来日公演还引起了很大话题。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f227c823ee8f4a4f865c695fb02d38e9da6b5f028514bbc954041924c0c1ac4b",
      "text": "没错！可是我，在抢票大战中输掉了……\n呜呜，真想在现场听听史密斯的吉他啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68225974e2359621f7f2f81bc80995d08b90f03d500be366b9b141f926a0656d",
      "text": "……我不太懂这个，\n史密斯的吉他，真的有那么厉害吗……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98130e9d02212d21560716f1c822fa87bae3f4543b5449ef67298c560123f3ed",
      "text": "那当然了！我觉得在座的各位里，\n应该也有喜欢ARROW・B的人吧……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc2ce7f7a61bed346bbe6457abbe1418f988ba376388a98b59761334fccdcba3",
      "text": "哦哦——，大家都有反应了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2453ed7abf89a5ad85fa51566753a23763318281f90bd3b4aa0d791a24dda2b9",
      "text": "哇，好高兴！果然最棒了呢！\n那么，听听看这个怎么样！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72d7d5ed327965b7c6c132d8be0a4b7f15584ef069ef982be62a51ce2dcf724a",
      "text": "好厉害！那是什么吉他技巧啊！\n简直狂霸酷拽叼炸天啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec17dd74e55a140f54c41ec97aace297d86c23f7dd367711612bbd91ac3a1a0a",
      "text": "那不是乐队的代表曲吗！\n你什么时候练出这种绝活的啊？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bbe507ce52208067e927838dd330391708a5b88ed9027f631dc7a8fc18f8f58",
      "text": "这段连复段实在太帅了，\n我唯独把这里练了超级多遍！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf3d5cb1faa1300ad3426e1c7297f87fd5b991abf33ce3679522e109edf0a63f",
      "text": "那么难的曲子你都学会了吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32e43a8c100ee51d2f9d2b2eec89198938f9c8790a7e7cdeb823dfbff696bedf",
      "text": "……我还想，再看一次。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3871c41419c1cd9a61ea65d4e740fe3613efd344e8585c856291d278da7e90f4",
      "text": "快看快看！会场的气氛超热烈哦。\n大家也想再听一次对吧——！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85fade10d81ab32a9a842633fb9cf7fb3aabeee6413aac4d459e86e50ca6e59c",
      "text": "再来一次！再来一次！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_b:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecf0e47735f7db089058e1b3b9981fc1b781e8602fddf7510637619189ee472b",
      "text": "嘿嘿，真拿你们没办法。\n那么……大家，我们上！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea780998177a50503000d5bcb2d4c5147ebd8e04e7673d722068345b412a980f",
      "text": "那么……大家，我们上！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1270544d3ddd7d0286e5d28003ce0321fce660e90ba84d6c25e15da46940593a",
      "text": "……哇哦！秋山的吉他太厉害了吧！\n会场的大家都兴奋得不行了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:980349f839b2c6673e1c6b6ad154d975a609a4f0d2d7f7ff9a6564d33dbe1706",
      "text": "刚才那段演唱会视频，在我们官方频道\n开设纪念视频中，也是关注度最为火爆的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73515440156c6dbcacd7f765101cfb09443cdc8adc3a1329c36e204073f2602",
      "text": "演奏技巧固然不必说，\n隼人那闪闪发光的笑容更是让人心头一颤啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28b3990790c74b9c7126af7c32967d7f31f6acecd3c805a05ed7bc7cd10c6973",
      "text": "嗯。这种对自己所爱之物的纯粹直率，\n一定也传达到了观看视频的人心中吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89d336efd568d1f5f648ccf79f1ccf431b50d9971d152c3124079029657a8f64",
      "text": "这么说的话，前几天上传的健身视频里\n诚司先生也毫不逊色呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c53b86cfb59cace78d61341696cf803d7db3409468289344cac28d03593590a8",
      "text": "我只是按照要求，\n把平时的训练情景拍下来了而已……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f21952481a44f5380cabd8ca3d4160ac73c93bdb75650b2447a78729ef1ed725",
      "text": "那份闪闪发光的笑容，可一点不输给隼人哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba031271c19c74d7d85ec2f4cf0a0ef2cbb47ddaab5855dbbcd0568eadec9160",
      "text": "是、是吗。稍微有点不好意思啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e586ba1cd5550f54db26a91d83135cd011569037ba6e6c8350a5ff3a38ee182",
      "text": "每一支视频一开始都只有1000次左右的播放量，\n但通过口碑传播都在逐步增长呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac2c5ff781eda35d322a9a82320b59e3445b5fb86c8b571255adea7c8e9f1d7",
      "text": "我们的热情，切实传达给了\n在屏幕另一端看着的人们啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336df07fcbcbd34fe2e04b922fd178267ec740224c3cf65839ef73f19dc78463",
      "text": "好。燃起更强烈的意志，\n让更多的人看到315 Pro的活动吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f45ee2a021ec72929eba21eb7e60a99ae9f5b488c03e5bf8b136c67f031beb",
      "text": "是啊，我们的目标可是出战JIF！\n必须要让更多的人认识我们才行。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dff144f13527826e0cdb0025465e68278481d3cd9b3ca5422b3e0cf860c8aed",
      "text": "……JAPAN IDOL FES，新人偶像的龙门跃升之选。\n想要获得出场资格，需要全国偶像粉丝的人气以及……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d503867516ed5a1dd4fc2619aa8e13fde6307bd9935282e3ca59851c15cdb01",
      "text": "乐曲的销量与演唱会的实绩，还有，\n恐怕也需要得到音乐节赞助商们的认可。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a81fe6e8663db006e5ce1eb6b38bccbc02ff61f18983f7caf60ac6a40011619",
      "text": "课题很多。不过，让我们一步一步向前迈进吧！\n总而言之现在，必须先磨炼作为偶像的力量。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:065879c558a769062ec330b5b47270ef70cb0239299c05f5e53116a1f3cc8ce0",
      "text": "没错。既然重新梳理好了目标，\n差不多该去上课练习了吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73526ae8630aae6d640fed11adbe821790c300d89b85228e0b3281f754efd464",
      "text": "诚司先生、英雄先生，今天也请多多关照！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f258f2cbd2445838ac02e2bcb2856e8ec8aca0469f30a7a9a96454110174ad4",
      "text": "（大家干劲十足啊！\n为了不输给大家，今天我也要努力跑业务！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000105:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e0d200f0504a02c665ef8b788e9652870d777e1f3d76d11a5ffe790edb879b",
      "text": "啊，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n是我，悠介哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000107:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:555a2bf6d17e93af95a4a5df1df200399ae42370e4dce3f553494e486389d040",
      "text": "关于频道开设纪念视频的事，\n我想到一个很棒的点子。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000109:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7cb70eee6f4d218839fae083cab267d7bacd6666ce26d74e378984928f96822",
      "text": "说起我和享介，果然还是足球吧？\n但是，光是普通的足球视频又不够有趣……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000111:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45d7c8dd7b0d45ea827bc9d715d6d90a210925b3f0ce1cb7811c6d00356049e",
      "text": "“足球不落地度过一整天！”\n这个企划，怎么样？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000113:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec738e1947ef7d13c13f2da65da24c66037424a1d922c14ea1a06060ed17790",
      "text": "听起来很有趣呢",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000114:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6946926200fe1e43deb596dfe8c4abb339de4d58fa38a251af36d21eb8fe2b1e",
      "text": "听起来好难啊",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000115:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672ab083e81c206eebfda2cffe80df6bdcaa4f745ab84b811dc45f51899d6fb9",
      "text": "播放量绝对会暴涨的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000117:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ea21b690928ad97de1116da2944b0fc7ae435c0d42b43ceb236c76a214d35b",
      "text": "对吧♪嘿嘿，这可是我和享介一起想出来的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000121:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c92896699bc94dffafce2182c701bca85a568d3d3878c64c80b878ac84304047",
      "text": "啊，是在担心能不能真的成功吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c694709c2b02c1be3b35fa4431c57d585891f3abd05adee3636ec4dd8e91de8b",
      "text": "没关系！觉得这方案绝对行得通，\n我也好好和享介商量过了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96fbdd7722e2fa6fdfa6ebdbe64177f07f5479e403386cbd63fbfdeaa6eb585a",
      "text": "太好了！既然●●●●●●●●●●监督\n都这么说了，那就绝对没问题了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000130:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c743bdf51d1c3e7108b62394c197fb6791cc47840e771c74a2b558bec2a395a",
      "text": "啊，不过，光是挑战感觉\n还有点不太够带劲呢～……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ee64468980c2d0303194e4a961ef18a6cd1632bf87b1fe810286e7fec38428",
      "text": "比如球掉下来的人要受惩罚游戏，\n或者球掉下来的人要请客便利店之类的……嗯～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_d:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7d6717f9a4ae0a7d770458cb253cc055b2e5807c2961ae1fe0ab76bf5bd830d",
      "text": "下次，●●●●●●●●●●监督也帮我们出出主意吧。\n叫上享介一起开个作战会议！那就先这样啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead549442ee6a9d108c60cf6fc87f3fa3e2ae5e45f0865175c7a5a6ebb4d74cf",
      "text": "哦，在涨在涨……\n●●●●プロデューサー也来看看这个！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fade659c1965d1c58edd6f7a7e493c55ae7c08dcf5b6ee5fa6d101087553a0b3",
      "text": "那个是前些天的演唱会视频吗？……等等，\n诶诶！？播放量超级暴涨了不是吗！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6e7cca4b61675e5268f9564f8f91ac75b484cee7bd55975141b6c9d296990c",
      "text": "是吧？照这个势头，我要不要把ARROW・B的\n其他歌曲也练一练传上去呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebe6844406228d48e5c1e9ded27ebbc70eb32b37f4693bfd8f25916a55b5e44a",
      "text": "我也不能服输啊！\n得想个能爆火的视频才行。嗯～～……啊！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4b67459f98ddaec43c44e0e3b70809d823a18574af392d2f51326d73b5a8b1c",
      "text": "“四季亲的百搭穿搭术”或者“挑战试吃\n流行便利店甜点”之类的，觉得怎么样！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7981809f8f2c5341d0cd6902fb5ddbface5c959de076588b922ac7c97a27e3",
      "text": "不错嘛，算我一个！\n再加上一期美味甜甜圈探店之旅！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa0b207adaa6a58f25b9b3c8e26abacf7bb02535909a5c0f7f6dcd49c625d192",
      "text": "隼人、春名先生、四季君……现在是训练时间。\n请集中注意力练习我们自己的歌曲。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25d07810321f2654a2a97f234aa3fe36f34f5b0fac634e860b94bebb825ba38c",
      "text": "你看，夏来连调音都已经做好了哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9d3f72742eb632efcb28ca45b635aacfb5ebe6231fb58339f7728efe060c7e0",
      "text": "我说，夏来也把喜欢的事或者日常琐事之类的，\n拍点什么做成视频呗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac2fa11e73b925799e391ee9e57e3563fb10523b195ffe23fdd5d40fc52e315",
      "text": "日常……喜欢的事……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7510b062add46901ce7b55bad427119d53f45d4704cf671e0234fcd1d8417dda",
      "text": "……干嘛看我啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aad44de8abdc5f144f743011f6b8411159e55e727e7304022f575aec4468a4b",
      "text": "呃、那个……\n那，“用小提琴来上一曲”……之类的？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3db4305edda2c5661d2a44e3d2e843c2009c0550f7e7c43f25d7709053fd4876",
      "text": "优雅是挺优雅的，但跟我们的画风一下子就完全变了啊。\n不过很有夏来的风格，也挺好！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd89b6b4d458a2b09677fbd39da311d34aebb74058368c239bf5648819502ed8",
      "text": "就是这种感觉，我们的视频企划。\n觉得怎么样，●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000205:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:593e5b4168d0402cce85a7d26ade63c13b7a8be6ee8023414f28699119d5c66d",
      "text": "每一个都很有大家的风格，非常棒……咦？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000216:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:149e4098be0c0154bf41bd2add08a7c8743ee03695112e0174e750c5ff5ab7dc",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000218:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca2c886e78d793c014839df968023a56738ff2c2cc1b2f249bd2a6d3190947c5",
      "text": "除了大家以外，大吾先生视频的播放量增加了将近3倍。\n发生什么事了呢……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000240:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da03bc1d028ddb840dd8269cc6efdf35bf4b4b880f8f51ae266f1b57e61b5c87",
      "text": "刚才没能接上电话，抱歉啦。\n●●●●●●●●●●老大，找俺有啥事不？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000242:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88bda2fc27f519a9a9c12e459280b37c38af7ead197eaf536b34c2ebfe4d8783",
      "text": "视频进入热门飙升了",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000243:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74ceea1a3ec83dc1ef3c9c9a7ef7a4193804b38e056d1a6d7f92b6f421e148b8",
      "text": "播放量太惊人了",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000244:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3262ff9ad8fed9cdc037e12317db743bb4e1bf84fe2921c3097b0843c1bc12d0",
      "text": "简直势如破竹呢",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000246:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87ff6a6e482057069d1350f47428277b74ea3552195bc162d8c32e070049a637",
      "text": "啊啊，是说那档子事啊！\n其实啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000250:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa6bcb6441c5d21ff9784f5e97c0fb2d857f520b02e9585c5eafbea5e3eccb3e",
      "text": "播放量？\n……啊啊，是那条视频的事啊！那个其实是……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000254:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c2b53dda407ae7d34acdab0cfe8ec89fce038862e920daa81aed255146b66e0",
      "text": "破竹？在说啥呢……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000256:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46f4c1af87e557d3312b84f1f2d85743c63743a25ac39883958f6fa4df7120cd",
      "text": "哎？视频的……播放量？\n啊啊！要是说那件事，其实啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000259:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d30be433241a5f41f28b3c8dc44b950e9637745f7557dd2e5ab339f8d9c3bef2",
      "text": "广岛的老爷子他们，\n好像发现俺的视频了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000261:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca9d8e05c251ae938d08e735e0bb5f2db72f7d919bd122bb88efac0453c91ff6",
      "text": "好像大家都跑去看了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000263:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97e0cc7566f34e27e646342bf8a54032621473c14691e71329728c2cb1216166",
      "text": "而且还靠着口口相传啥的，\n推荐给了各种各样的人的样子。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000265:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6438cb0d1def8208b0916d1a42f842b823d7621b86a76be1f9550a483443e198",
      "text": "俺觉得怪不好意思的，\n视频的事本来一直瞒着没说……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000267:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e0527c9a7cfec08fe15eb007055171a99415d87c943e7ff4409a8c0e56d07f",
      "text": "嘛，不过也能让他们看到俺精神的样子，\n这就叫皆大欢喜啦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_e:cmd-000269:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5513373590470caef0021b8b9c8ebbce87136f1b82ca67a11e519e8796cd587d",
      "text": "闹腾了这么一场抱歉啦！\n要是还有啥事，尽管喊俺！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa52a42ab9e493704eca8c86f7afe3edaf46375a231d0a935524329d8deeb4dd",
      "text": "制、制作人！不得了了！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccb8db7c9ea82f7e53d15fe4c5af71add0c0ffe64b5e2247ea17996ee01b350",
      "text": "你们来得正好！其实大家的\n演唱会视频突然以完全不同数量级的速度猛涨……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3034d962d326785ed4f201d1c8d188e810a420684f07666e1a7f9f33f2c463e9",
      "text": "就是那个就是那个！没想到史密斯亲本人看到了，\n还在SNS上给了回应哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c52cb931ed7355ad415b5ed71d2ceb6cf031341bd5438905d305258fec288a",
      "text": "哎哎！？史密斯亲是指，\nARROW・B的本人吗！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fcbc6b6af9feec75ae9ffcbfbf68780199f788b74be3161a5c5a54383f6246e",
      "text": "哎呀，虽说是回应，但也只是“日本的孩子，\nSO COOL！HAHAHA！”这种感觉的内容啦……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b14e93cae83adc5f60f703da640966ec9ccaa0cc0459045a2a958fad1300dc2",
      "text": "就算这样，世界级艺术家的反应也是很厉害的！\n而且你看，现在播放量也还在不断攀升中……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a035a5eeb78246d5abd90c512465a064ade3e22f0d15f57586f2b2e69beeecc",
      "text": "……不需要，回复吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4fea0d69b4ceaee7ac046fa39ea67067d20fa790184bc641281d6cce5306705",
      "text": "确实！必须要向史密斯先生道谢才行！\n我们拍一条回复用的视频吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94990c764a8d06fe6d03a8b0d0a4c6d0edfedcd02ddbba47cbba0bd9eccac1db",
      "text": "……好、好嘞。史密斯先生！\n谢谢你观看我们的视频！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f711f2b91af734f58ca7f7fb957c0ca60b6df936d4181eab920dba143a7829c8",
      "text": "我一直都很尊敬史密斯先生……\n那个，所以，真的超级高兴！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6014efad86de65b4bf5c4e17c98321e2270806eec15936213c379abf9af9f7c",
      "text": "哎？讲日语吗？\n这种时候果然还是讲英语比较好吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa93249ae001433bc7e02190082ee259cc9da1060536604212777d0e6de5a26",
      "text": "四季，变得会说英语了吗……？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9858a26e2a8989ff7e9b5edf883c3f28c0335b3c295e6af4cbf92d7147eebb7",
      "text": "当然！耶——！\n史密斯亲，Giga Thank You！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1660c941ac0045f02a634dc52ef81af96006a17abb9b0f0d5145fddfd6838f8a",
      "text": "哪来的Giga Thank You啊……\n根本就不存在这种英语好吗……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb6655974a9372beed3065515f94428b9aa207f525ad4fa9174bc53dcbceab9",
      "text": "接下来轮到旬亲了！拜托啦☆",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13fa341ebbbcf7e377e00414635b4721ec743090acc1375693faa7055011c83a",
      "text": "哎！？啊……咳咳。\n三、Thank you very much。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77055b7f3d7b82ca31b72f635d3cb99c0bf202347130564930d1333622aacd5",
      "text": "……接下来，是我。\nMr. 史密斯，Thank you……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc54e8043b4888ae99107f9dc3113e8739242fa0720c44021f1bb498b18de57d",
      "text": "……最后是春名。你会说英语的吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4e6ff9da265322f6cf30f2ead2316245dac369ddcd0664d64b2324d36090b7a",
      "text": "嘛，是会啦。不过，就算不用特地用英语传达，\n大家的感谢之情也已经传过去了吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9c1e43146e45e7b88de4d1e3b10159d797c1c59b90ca37a5d5b5d0c4ceb4edb",
      "text": "不过嘛，我也来说一句。\nThank you so much！Smith！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000109:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c2a2f6471a91557e5cc7d870a83bc269aa4f9764d54092408b80411e3921e8",
      "text": "刚才那段视频，我已经发到我们的官方SNS上了哦。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb6e17dea4b0c5c30082f8ecf8bb7f58e29a502a2e77d7219507a59907b83d7e",
      "text": "呐呐，会有回复来吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8aeba325b41b84c770ddd2544129ba2ceb9ea7cd43f7d2655df4e1ee7fff757",
      "text": "就算会来，也不会那么快就……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37d0d9228495b7e41c0201aacb490ec7e54622a3b5758060ed9ba05d37496a61",
      "text": "嗯？邮件？……英语？\n……是史密斯的经纪人发来的！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:475ee472a8aff37ec9f6c9633af855b73f033acd00b5369d9102ac69a67e2f82",
      "text": "怎么了怎么了！？上面写了什么啊！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:976189e22bb21bf65095513c2826690f7c657e9f04168a386884cf6bee4c2544",
      "text": "我现在读。“……史密斯对视频非常感动，\n务必想要和大家见上一面”……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b76718c254eab6e3afae8486d7d563f88355ca4b775bc8bc93d1fa7b56ac1a4b",
      "text": "……想要见一面，那个史密斯要见我们！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_g:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3860bb50c10719827e2464c7441c7853dd17e5fe6926049ff468a9d991aae8f",
      "text": "真、真的假的——！！？？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36674fee8c577df29b19d1802ae9e18b60dfd8fa7f31af965ddc06d24906fc95",
      "text": "……总而言之，那位ARROW・B的史密斯，\n想要邀请High×Joker去演唱会的相关人员席位。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5971beb364f00fb59a0bb87b806e01b0ec5029ea878d07f0fe90767639a0bcc0",
      "text": "而且，还附带了在后台休息室一起拍视频的\n邀请，大家当时都欣喜若狂呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e205ecd4fcaefebc847313098ad285776e2b4780ab63f8a4fdc79e7410641dda",
      "text": "那当然了，收到那位ARROW・B发来的联络，\n不管是换作谁都会情绪暴涨的啊……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0d182337b860821fc769db18e23b5d593e8a7a20f33e5ebfe4dd487ff8e6a4",
      "text": "多亏了史密斯，315 Pro官方频道的\n播放量也水涨船高……影响力真大啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074d728c5227ee819b348fac9b203acb32b81e88d3dd0caad7f0e070c3f39bb9",
      "text": "我接着上次的内容，尝试上传了在任何地方都能轻松完成的\n健身视频……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee5f6b799d5b67b3eb795f384652b6d3f6cb600d9ad80a2321b1836ffdb10ff7",
      "text": "反响比上一次还要热烈呢！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7326a0ed706c4a4f147891384852e039b519aeab30891fb7da3e79ff89ca38f7",
      "text": "喜欢健身的人和注重健康的人群等，\n似乎都开始关注诚司先生的视频了。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f4a0115ba5d8bebd1e4046563eff593e4ccbb282fead95cc15cac4c48e5e59",
      "text": "果然，将自己喜欢的东西传播出去这种方针\n是正确的啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47a8eb068aed8423419276e6351de2f3d14e36ab7118130855ec3ed644c28df",
      "text": "所以说，我下次打算上传一段\n和我家狗在一起的视频。龙呢？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a279f3cb9cc1f119fcb8a8b24104c79aaf86ee3159d14a91ec159980c1168681",
      "text": "我打算靠我拿手的缝纫视频来迎战！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8709949d6ec892a5d22ee0da1d02cd074b44ad47344f15a86fe0e5b4f75dd1d9",
      "text": "（拿手的……？）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2358701712dba9adba677159c29a736b695afa4f4c90d2b652ca77006f779396",
      "text": "如果High×Joker的各位，也能通过和史密斯的视频\n让活跃度得到进一步扩展就好了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b32c39f8f42c542fed29667161b026d9465c27bd8839f938549936515897a26",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n我会替各位转告他们的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc983ca7e952a867c41bf85bef11b203da01cc887fb48e4a2b2a8cedc72e9730",
      "text": "距离ARROW・B的演唱会\n只剩下一周了哦",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000149:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a2779a40f32a0bd5c387cc76de0d28f8d2d9033904d45139c001e0d24302fe9",
      "text": "终于能见到史密斯了！\n怎么办\n该穿什么去才好！？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7ea92c99bc93d4a6ce734240edc093c879566f33534e67ff2ace6af249839bc",
      "text": "果然还是穿时髦便服比较好吗",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000152:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db378a904948f8df19681f062e1079e8bdacc9e290e17b09e17dbe8fe78607d",
      "text": "照平时那样就没问题的",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000153:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a06408933984a846bcd97eb95269297a0734e545770da56f27b7664af7624f",
      "text": "和服觉得怎么样",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000156:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:181b0624142f1c7753661187480950252d7be39632ec3b4b6abfb253f7610c4b",
      "text": "时髦便服那种东西\n我根本没有啊——！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000161:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b88d40ef8858d0640f4daf4dcb87637cf9f3ed9504df3c38630d6114f0a887",
      "text": "真的吗？\n和平常一样就没问题吗",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000166:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0506007edd9355eb46a69645ceeea11a824a17b5b10bd9456ce1585d8a329bab",
      "text": "和服！？\n我不知道怎么穿啊——！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000169:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34053d4e2b92c484cb7f198c7b9c7d560e139f332ac6e99054b03d35a963ac4b",
      "text": "隼人亲，要是穿不习惯的衣服\n不是反而会更加紧张吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000171:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c7628a9b3b45d1fd16c17ce9862292b8c78beced0f5a42a383e6652242236f",
      "text": "这种时候和平常一样才是\n满分大正解吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000173:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b03182736c736f42831054e8991cc4745a667835a13c2ef3fce56a948c145d9a",
      "text": "顺便一提我会在平时的衣服上\n搭配一件压箱底单品！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000175:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:733c837b9840894f67f0f68023589a880e63fa36935546612166528cbcc5d4da",
      "text": "压箱底？那是什么？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000177:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86524b834939437018772744d82bf173f82b9cd19186739dd06f99275247db88",
      "text": "是只在重要日子才会穿的\n秘密心头好哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d768ac08e0052bedcfd82bd6078dd63579e6e0e87bac51e110d54500bfe0e44d",
      "text": "为当天操心固然是好，\n但太得意忘形可得注意。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbf9431c1db511f7177250c953211b393f6de8452d462404218a83517f0bba06",
      "text": "毕竟今天的练习，\n整体上失误很多。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84dc2212989f3afc69b3c1c1a4788493396f6a290ed9f331198594fb5c07a10b",
      "text": "对不起——……\n我完全飘了",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316604d71a9dfc87672cfa3cc45e89bbcca9bd732a6f045788f3d094d93f29fa",
      "text": "没关系。坐立不安这种事，\n大家都是一样的。\n大概，旬也是。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4d68a3f3e90d91f4650253cdcf6d9f38bd7d1158c41c5f5b97a398826b9efc3",
      "text": "旬最近，一直都在听\nARROW・B的歌。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_h:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da4a8fdc06efd8dbb37f04ed56ca2acbefe748e51afb6603f51b03e203b7d430",
      "text": "那个只是演唱会的预习！\n总而言之大家，\n都给我打起精神绷紧点！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb1099a1f78342fb9c1b309defe0cc08ca0d64d0e64e917e2b208cebce82eab",
      "text": "ARROW・B演唱会当天……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:713913b4192d1d798210ac6dc72718992895730734b88efc4a27d71ed5ff2f10",
      "text": "不妙……一想到马上就能见到史密斯，\n就变得超级紧张。手汗止都止不住啊～～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65de1f56c019af045669dec125aa4b56405167cd686d3b25fb94bf95221d4af5",
      "text": "……旬，还好吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60bae5f1752d45710783a1aba178b8d0565365c1270e4860668d21134b9530f7",
      "text": "对方可是世界级的大明星，再怎么说也会……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b50661aca7a493ff8671117da69bad6414c3d8999ce06a30d395c1b3d719202",
      "text": "对了对了，我也为了今天，\n特意狠狠地打扮了一番哦！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a8eb215d7fa6cc950431b98ae04abf1a0874d125b03b57039e6c2223b799cb",
      "text": "说起来，你在LINK上也说过呢。\n可是……和平时不是没什么两样吗？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b55d659a95217a4cf875920384f7e401794db073db04a38149b6b6a805f668",
      "text": "啧啧啧。真正的时尚，\n可是要在看不见的地方一决胜负的！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3cfe2541ec14ffdf6e165e0fd2b59102e7c3d811c7b3dd76b2b7e3bb9b1932",
      "text": "Please come in！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c79a1b6d8eca40bc35f14d5bd6d6d3effce4f5d1fbfca0d2c27c0bfe36f5ad5",
      "text": "哇哇……叫、叫我们了！\nY、YES！这就来！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b5dd7cced0f55169b288703f99d65b3e1f486c5313f43950708b40b804d8d1a",
      "text": "欢饮！谢谢泥们、能来！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59b318c2885f8b57d7b21c8cd78cd60682ef56f128a8d5fc997a4d356c3667b3",
      "text": "是真正的史密斯……！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_i:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4beab0e02c1ef8b866ed321235fb0052f3b99838e92b18a315917acaf47d9da",
      "text": "Thank you Thank you！\nThank you very much！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000032:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba63e55bead7e4350d9f569924ed2458129858455c0df35e3262ecbdb8e7e90b",
      "text": "演唱会落幕后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea696e87792400d0edced93206346736932ede0d4c3c88bf48bc2107243c692e",
      "text": "哈啊……ARROW・B的演唱会，\n真是超级无敌MAX，太厉害了啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48ae3ab44b96b3442c60da94184d48814a216d6ecadfd2fd21e9082ed3da6f6b",
      "text": "演唱会也是，之前的休息室招待也是。\n说实话，我都记不太清到底聊了些什么了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c50db7d5eb021b661a7906de58287e5df50757bcd473c4589c5608439110ec",
      "text": "……嗯。我其实也是这样。\n但是史密斯说的一句话，我觉得特别震撼人心。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664a4eb11748318d4519d11cb32e6adde591d3e805d857977a9a2643ee260af9",
      "text": "“ARROW・B无论过去还是现在，都深爱着乐队与粉丝。\n正因如此，才会时刻不断地持续努力。”这句话。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b86ca9ba6371134588a1492b87c36e8158346164a2b75e122e2bcf2c95b6a40",
      "text": "……我也，对乐队的喜爱绝不输给史密斯……\n我是深爱着High×Joker的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d114a7bf921ea445a55100923bbbbd03c72fc1d051b2f581eafcfe11cd30df",
      "text": "无论是成员，还是支持我们的人，我都最喜欢了！\n所以……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cfafdf024fcac38c054ebf23f25c06e84bde7f755f7cd34ad51adb9fff8693d",
      "text": "我们总有一天，也想站上这样的舞台。\n……不。我绝对，要把大家带到这里来！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:893427cf49acb332c92677f853bfcaebf0b1c2c035d70cf2fa3f78eb3fe68a3f",
      "text": "隼人……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39bb01bbd91462966e00f32066b7696620d4ec9ac4e996612ffb3e49336a27ce",
      "text": "……没错！下次轮到我们，\n站上那个舞台给大家看！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6c235e12463c9b401d26889244c04366078ab2d3cc0685911407ae4f65234e4",
      "text": "……我会跟随你的，队长。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13481ada97b1dd734bb088258525fcaf8d4b30988da993c364f007214fd736d5",
      "text": "啊啊。我们上吧，凭借我们这最强的5个人！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000177:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28a057886193dcb6a54a29b5b17a1b3f926ea3fa5b610e930eb8b4618f2636d7",
      "text": "英雄先生家的狗，好帅啊——！\n在视频里看也超级有魄力呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85b8a543b7827e3d80f628ce8d4d51eff3528752d4765acb8bc592146ffaff82",
      "text": "……两手各抱一只，杜宾犬……呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000212:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f50ef23ac76e524ae826cae78eb8d2ca3392571b419ff6a383df6c855abb4c1",
      "text": "狗狗视频啊，英雄亲也真会想呢！\n狗狗亲和英雄亲都笑得好棒！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000223:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cabbf90030c261dd0f6908f972256e0a1bb02a2dc3e97c1d34ec43da4917e614",
      "text": "好啦，休息结束。继续练习。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000237:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f5bcea673be736bb386aa69e30e97aebdac3727734cb53d8c60d1e8596a098",
      "text": "了解！大家，加油冲吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000269:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a59031b139247789c47d3599dff427a21b21aa6764983e6145913f635e822b3",
      "text": "（自从与史密斯先生见面之后，\n大家练习起来似乎更加投入了！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000278:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ba84dc2e47d08054438d1991f4d80523194e569232e5bdcfd5758f07cb4663",
      "text": "（面向出战JIF，知名度也提上来了。\n从这里开始，想要获得更多人气的话……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
